% references.bib — the single shared bibliography for this repository.
%
% biblatex + biber; main.tex loads it once via \addbibresource and prints one
% bibliography. Every module and every solution dossier cites into this file.
%
% A ledger node with `provenance: literature` must carry an `import_class` and list
% BibTeX keys from this file in its `references:` field; scripts/check.py verifies
% that each key resolves here. Add the entry before you add the node.
%
% An unreviewed preprint cannot support a proved node: `import_class:
% preprint-unreviewed` keeps the node open until the result is checked at source.
